{"ref":"BDB, בֶּ֫כֶר","hw":"בֶּ֫כֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּ֫כֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>young camel</em>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بَكْرٌ</span>, Assyrian <em>bakru</em> Asrb.<sup>Annals ix. 65</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Ephraim <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:35\" href=\"/Numbers.26.35\">Nu. 26:35</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּרֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.20\">1 Ch 7:20</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Benjamin <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:21\" href=\"/Genesis.46.21\">Gn 46:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.6\">1 Ch 7:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.8\">8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּ֑כֶר)</span>.","next":"BDB, בַּכְרִי","prev":"BDB, בְּכוֹר"}